OL,3,AChildren and woman injured on
OL,4,Afairground ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlyth Lane was closed between Muglet
OL,7,FLane and Victoria Road to allow people
OL,8,Fto safely exit the fairground, the
OL,9,Fforce added, with the road since
OL,10,Freopening.
